{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve late cause initialization for the existing constructor.** Delegating to the new overload invokes `Throwable(String, null)`, which permanently initializes the cause. Existing callers that use `initCause(...)` after either old constructor will now receive `IllegalStateException`. Keep the old `super(message)` initialization and field assignments in this constructor, reserving the cause-aware superclass call for the new overload.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77480T","finding_digest":"bf7b60fd957a151a72d622234850fb7884cd0934d0afab853cd4d39bec0d850c","finding_id":"arf_v1_x55wb7mvpikru4wweiruquh3pc","finding_key":"sdk/exception/unrecoverabledurableexecutionexception::two-arg-constructor::initcause-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/exception/unrecoverabledurableexecutionexception::two-arg-constructor::initcause-compatibility","line":13,"observation_digest":"cd41db79d302f319bf4bd564df867cca863a80c7007b4ac1bb220530c3297dd1","observation_id":"aro_v1_zva5w6otalzrtp2l2vsn7bt4zk","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/exception/UnrecoverableDurableExecutionException.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-09T02:19:30Z","review_id":"arr_v1_miy3nph6wuhtx5lw47zhwpb4pu","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"be44fd7d1447323978b318872275a4db5afef6f1","reviewer":"codex","start_line":13,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_nh3ng3pwftoggehj5a7o3bwbqe"},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_z6zqm4cfb7itcx6jtsejeew6qy","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T02:19:30Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
